距離を維持したまま似合う方です。 どうか先生が描きたいように描いてくださったらと思います。 衣装や状況も関係ありません！\n\nもし依頼内容に不備があったり、金額がご期待に及ばなかったりしたら、キャンセルまたは再送をお願いしていただけないでしょうか。再び調整いたしてもよろしいです。\n\nお読み頂きましてありがとうございます。引き続きよろしくお願いいたします。ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CwPTTmjSfU5QoqZSA_JWFnEH8_CUhSaF?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 492611, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "piku", "screen_name": "_pikurusu00", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1289922398536347657/CTWA-aqy.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3244365848/1596376523/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 2, "complete_expiration_days": 45, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 177}, {"id": 1366068, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "お、", "screen_name": "ooo_0926", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1976456505617678337/k4n0GrRE.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1393369213792751620/1768864254/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 49}, {"id": 3293869, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "９ソ２号", "screen_name": "sub9so", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2022270660651937792/gYbSIVLn.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "com